    "description": "<p>Si les personnages de Jules Romains sont capables de communiquer presque instantan&eacute;ment par les voies de l&rsquo;esprit, le temps s&rsquo;&eacute;coule en revanche tr&egrave;s lentement dans certains de ses romans. Comment expliquer ce paradoxe&nbsp;?</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>While Jules Romains&#39; characters are capable of communicating almost instantaneously through their minds, time passes very slowly in some of his novels. How can we explain this paradox?</p>"
  },
